## What EXIF Data Tells You

### 📱 Device Information
- **Make/Model**: What phone took the screenshot (e.g., "iPhone 8 Plus")
- **Software**: iOS version or Android version
- **Proves**: Who took the screenshots (based on device ownership)

### 📅 Timeline Data
- **DateTimeOriginal**: Exact moment screenshot was captured
- **Proves**: When conversation occurred, duration of session
- **Your case**: Screenshots span April 4-6, 2019 (2 days, 19 hours)

### 📷 Technical Metadata
- **Image dimensions**: Screen resolution
- **File size**: Can indicate image editing/manipulation
- **Camera settings**: Usually N/A for screenshots but present for photos

### 🌍 GPS Data (Usually Absent)
- **GPS coordinates**: Location where image was taken
- **Your screenshots**: GPS stripped (common for screenshots)

### ⚖️ Legal Value
- **Authenticity**: Unmodified EXIF suggests genuine screenshots
- **Chain of custody**: Proves when evidence was created
- **Attribution**: Device info can link to specific person

